<title>UK: Union up on bid talk.</title>
<headline>Union up on bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Union Plc jumped by eight percent after the financial services and trading group said it had received several unsolicited approaches over the last few weeks, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1013 GMT, the shares were up 7p to 93-1/2. They were the biggest gainers in London.  </p>
<p>The group also said it would withdraw from proprietary trading  nL25222199. --London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
